M NaCl) at 37 °C for 60 min and wash three times with 20% ethanol to completely remove detergents. The purified proteins on beads were digested with 8 ng/μL Trypsin (Promega) and 1.6 ng/μL Lys-C (Wako) in 50 mM ammonium bicarbonate at 37 °C overnight on an end-over-end rotator. Digestion mixtures were acidified to pH <3 using trifluoroacetic acid (TFA), desalted with StageTips, and lyophilized. LC-MS/MS Analysis. Peptide samples were dissolved in a solution of 5% ACN and 4% FA. The resulting samples were analyzed by a nano-flow liquid chromatography coupled to a Thermo Fisher Orbitrap Q Exactive, Q Exactive HF-X, Orbitrap Fusion or Bruker timsTOF Pro mass spectrometer. Detailed instrument settings can be found in SI Appendix, Supplemental Methods.\n'}], 'model': 'gpt-5.4-nano-2026-03-17', 'store': True, 'temperature': 0.3}}
